{
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "94441",
      "field": "detail",
      "english": "Please give my thanks to Danitha Morr and tell her that the rest of the Deathguard will hear about the service that the paladins of Bandarion Keep performed for us. \n\nYou have a lot of promise as a paladin, and I am proud to have those like you among the ranks of the Forsaken. Dark Lady watch over you, <Name>."
    },
    {
      "id": "94441",
      "field": "objective",
      "english": "Speak with Danitha Morr in the keep at Bandarion Keep."
    },
    {
      "id": "95314",
      "field": "title",
      "english": "That Shadowvale Green Elixir"
    },
    {
      "id": "95314",
      "field": "detail",
      "english": "Before the Scourge invasion, the reclusive village of Shadowvale was known for its Whispering Elixir. Distilled from herbs found only in Tyr's Fall, the elixir was sought by apothecaries, mystics, and poisoners alike even after being banned in the city.\n\nI've had requests from a number of buyers eager to get their hands on some elixir. Travel to the ruins of Shadowvale deep in the Whispering Forest to the west. I'm prepared to offer significant compensation if you can recover some bottles for me."
    },
    {
      "id": "95314",
      "field": "objective",
      "english": "Collect 8 Bottles of Whispering Elixir from Shadowvale, then return to Carolai Anise in Brill."
    },
    {
      "id": "95328",
      "field": "title",
      "english": "Whispering Horror Residue"
    },
    {
      "id": "95328",
      "field": "detail",
      "english": "Against your better judgement you scrape up and collect the squirming remains of the beast. Someone in Undercity might have a use for them."
    },
    {
      "id": "95328",
      "field": "objective",
      "english": "Deliver Whispering Horror Residue to Father Lankester in the War Quarter of Undercity."
    },
    {
      "id": "95803",
      "field": "title",
      "english": "A Token of Good Faith"
    },
    {
      "id": "95803",
      "field": "detail",
      "english": "Now that we've claimed the head of the tarnished commander, I need you to deliver it to the Undercity. Sylvanas Windrunner mistrusts us greatly, and all but openly disparages us.\n\nDeliver Rudolph Gelhardt's head to the Dark Lady. Show her that we tend to our own house and are devoted to the prosperity of the forsaken."
    },
    {
      "id": "95803",
      "field": "objective",
      "english": "Bring the head of Rudolph Gelhardt to Sylvanas Windrunner in the Undercity."
    },
    {
      "id": "96607",
      "field": "title",
      "english": "The Great Outdoors"
    },
    {
      "id": "96607",
      "field": "detail",
      "english": "Greetings, <Class>. I can see you've got the look of an adventurer about you. This is good. The world needs more of us restless souls, seeking fortune and glory.\n\nYou'll need to learn to thrive in the wilds to be successful in this line of work. Not sure how your outdoor skills are but I can probably teach you a thing or two, if you'd be apt to learn.\n\nHave a seat near the fire and get comfortable. I'll walk you through it."
    },
    {
      "id": "96607",
      "field": "objective",
      "english": "Sit near Eleanor's Basic Campfire and wait until you receive the Boosted Rest buff."
    },
    {
      "id": "96656",
      "field": "title",
      "english": "The Adventurer"
    },
    {
      "id": "96656",
      "field": "detail",
      "english": "<Name>, you have proven yourself trustworthy in your endeavors against the Scarlet Crusade so far. That is why I am now entrusting you with an unusual task.\n\nI've heard of a new adventurer down the road by Brill. Go and see what she's doing."
    },
    {
      "id": "96656",
      "field": "objective",
      "english": "Speak to Eleanor Shackleton near Brill."
    }
  ],
